<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>XAUUSD Trading Assistant</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#0b1020;color:#eee;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
main{max-width:700px;margin:auto;padding:15px}
h1{font-size:22px;margin:5px 0}
h2{font-size:17px}
.card{background:#151d30;border:1px solid #293550;border-radius:15px;padding:15px;margin:12px 0}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
label{font-size:12px;color:#aaa}
input,select{width:100%;padding:12px;margin-top:5px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid #40506d;background:#0d1527;color:white;font-size:15px}
button{width:100%;padding:14px;margin-top:10px;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:#2563eb;color:white;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold}
.reset{background:#374151}
.status{text-align:center;padding:15px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:bold;font-size:18px;margin-top:10px}
.wait{background:#493b08;color:#ffe68a}
.buy{background:#064e3b;color:#a7f3d0}
.sell{background:#7f1d1d;color:#fecaca}
.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #293550}
.small{font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;line-height:1.5}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<main>

<h1>🥇 XAUUSD Trading Assistant</h1>
<div class="small">Manual data entry • Automatic calculations</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>H1 Data</h2>
<div class="small">Enter the 5 most recently completed H1 candle closes. Do NOT use the current forming candle.</div>

<div class="grid">
<div><label>Close 1 — oldest</label><input id="c1" type="number" step=".01"></div>
<div><label>Close 2</label><input id="c2" type="number" step=".01"></div>
<div><label>Close 3</label><input id="c3" type="number" step=".01"></div>
<div><label>Close 4</label><input id="c4" type="number" step=".01"></div>
<div><label>Close 5 — newest</label><input id="c5" type="number" step=".01"></div>
<div><label>Previous H1 High</label><input id="ph" type="number" step=".01"></div>
<div><label>Previous H1 Low</label><input id="pl" type="number" step=".01"></div>
<div><label>Previous H1 Close</label><input id="pc" type="number" step=".01"></div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Breakout / Retest</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div><label>Breakout level</label><input id="bo" type="number" step=".01"></div>
<div><label>Retest price</label><input id="rt" type="number" step=".01"></div>
<div><label>M15 close after retest</label><input id="m15" type="number" step=".01"></div>
<div><label>Direction</label>
<select id="dir">
<option value="BUY">BUY</option>
<option value="SELL">SELL</option>
</select>
</div>
</div>
<div class="small">BUY: M15 close above breakout = retest holds.<br>
SELL: M15 close below breakout = retest holds.</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Trade Plan</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div><label>Entry</label><input id="entry" type="number" step=".01"></div>
<div><label>Stop Loss</label><input id="sl" type="number" step=".01"></div>
<div><label>TP1</label><input id="tp1" type="number" step=".01"></div>
<div><label>TP2</label><input id="tp2" type="number" step=".01"></div>
</div>

<button onclick="analyze()">ANALYZE XAUUSD</button>
<button class="reset" onclick="resetApp()">RESET</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Results</h2>
<div id="status" class="status wait">WAITING FOR DATA</div>
<div id="results"></div>
</div>

<div class="small">
This tool is for analysis and planning only. It does not place broker orders.
</div>

</main>

<script>
function num(id){
 let x=parseFloat(document.getElementById(id).value);
 return Number.isFinite(x)?x:null;
}

function f(x){
 return x==null||!Number.isFinite(x)?"—":x.toFixed(2);
}

function add(label,value){
 return '<div class="row"><span>'+label+'</span><b>'+value+'</b></div>';
}

